      "role": "user",
      "content": "Wait, you're saying it's \"overwhelmingly viewed as a failure\"? That sounds pretty definitive. I thought some economists argued that the broader economic growth and lower consumer prices from these kinds of deals actually help lower-income families in the long run. Shouldn't that be part of the success side?",
