      "content": "I hear you, but calling them \"classic corporate talking points\" seems pretty biased. If I'm writing an academic paper, shouldn't I be looking at a more objective view? Like, can you actually explain the logical framework behind the pro-TPP side without just dismissing it as a mask for corporate interests?",
